        <div class="kicker">The problem</div>
        <h2>A search can start with thousands of spaces—and still start in the wrong place.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-trust__problem-copy">
        <p class="about-trust__statement">Finding commercial space shouldn't be this hard for a smaller business.</p>
        <p>When Rofo began, smaller businesses were often poorly served by a process built around larger commissions and longer commitments. Better access to listings helped. But finding a listing was never the whole decision.</p>
        <p>The business, the people it needs to reach, the way it operates and the character of the location all help determine where a search should begin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

